# composeApp Harness

Full rules: `composeApp/docs/HARNESS.md`.

## Before any code change under `composeApp/`

1. **Read** `composeApp/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` with the Read tool (required).
2. For multi-file or design work, also **read** `composeApp/docs/PLANNING.md`.
3. Implement only within existing layers; do not break ARCHITECTURE §7 invariants.
4. Do not put adb/ProcessBuilder in `ui`; orchestrate via `MainStateHolder`.

## After code changes under `composeApp/`

Run the H3 checklist in `composeApp/docs/HARNESS.md`: update outdated tech docs (`ARCHITECTURE.md`, `PLANNING.md`, `composeApp/AGENTS.md`, root `AGENTS.md`, `README.md`, rules) or explicitly state that no doc update is needed and why.
